.fi
.SS CONVERSATION GET
Fetch one conversation detail record.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi conversation get C012ABC
.fi
.nf
slack-axi conversation get '#eng' --fields id,name,topic
.fi
.SS CONVERSATION RESOLVE
Resolve a conversation selector to a stable ID.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
