.fi
.nf
slack-axi user get U012ABC
.fi
.SS USER SEARCH
Search cached users with explicit source coverage.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi user search alice
.fi
.nf
slack-axi user search alice --fields id,name,display_name
.fi
.SS USER GET
Fetch one user detail record.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi user get U012ABC
.fi
.nf
slack-axi user get @alice --fields id,display_name,timezone
.fi
.SS USERGROUP
Inspect Slack user groups.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi usergroup list
.fi
.nf
slack-axi usergroup members S012ABC
.fi
.SS USERGROUP LIST
List a bounded page of normalized active user groups.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20; continuation cursors are bound to the exact returned user-group snapshot
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi usergroup list
.fi
.nf
slack-axi usergroup list --limit 50 --fields id,handle,name
.fi
.SS USERGROUP MEMBERS
List a bounded page of one user group's members.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20; continuation cursors are bound to the exact returned membership snapshot
