Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi usergroup members S012ABC
.fi
.nf
slack-axi usergroup members S012ABC --limit 100 --fields id,display_name,email,timezone
.fi
.SS EMOJI
Search workspace emoji.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi emoji search party
.fi
.nf
slack-axi emoji search deploy --limit 10
.fi
.SS EMOJI SEARCH
Search cached workspace emoji.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi emoji search party
.fi
.nf
slack-axi emoji search party --limit 10
.fi
.SS READ
Read a bounded conversation timeline with thread summaries.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 50; rolling 24-hour range ending now when no time flag is supplied; continuation cursors carry the cumulative scanned count
.br
Incompatible combinations: Use only one of --since, --from, or --on; --on also conflicts with --to.
.nf
slack-axi read '#eng' --since 24h
.fi
.nf
slack-axi read C012ABC --on 2026-08-15
.fi
.nf
slack-axi read C012ABC --from 2026-08-15T09:00:00+02:00 --to 2026-08-15T17:00:00+02:00
.fi
.SS THREAD
Read a bounded page of one Slack thread.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 50; message text previews are capped at 600 Unicode characters; continuation cursors carry the cumulative scanned count
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi thread T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi thread T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --full
.fi
.SS SEARCH
Search Slack messages or files with bounded results.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi search messages incident
.fi
.nf
slack-axi search files roadmap
.fi
.SS SEARCH MESSAGES
Search messages with optional Slack-native filters.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20; --sort score; one result page
.br
Incompatible combinations: --all requires --max-results; --max-results is invalid without --all; --limit conflicts with --all; --after must be earlier than --before.
.nf
slack-axi search messages regression --in '#eng'
.fi
.nf
slack-axi search messages incident --all --max-results 250 --sort timestamp
.fi
.SS SEARCH FILES
Search files with normalized bounded rows.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20; --sort score; one result page
.br
Incompatible combinations: --all requires --max-results; --max-results is invalid without --all; --limit conflicts with --all; --after must be earlier than --before.
.nf
slack-axi search files roadmap
.fi
.nf
slack-axi search files report --all --max-results 100
.fi
.SS INBOX
Summarize unread activity with browser-session counts or a bounded user-token fallback.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20; muted conversations excluded in browser mode; user-token mode probes at most 50 conversations and cannot prove mention or mute state
.br
Incompatible combinations: --partner-only conflicts with --internal-only; --dm-only conflicts with a non-DM --type.
.nf
slack-axi inbox --mentions-only
.fi
.nf
slack-axi inbox --partner-only --limit 20
.fi
.nf
slack-axi inbox --dm-only --include-muted
.fi
.SS CATCHUP
Summarize recent activity across bounded conversations.
.PP
Defaults: --since 24h; --max-conversations 20 (maximum 50); --per-conversation 5 (maximum 20); omitted conversations are represented by a count and at most five sample rows
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi catchup --since 24h
.fi
.nf
slack-axi catchup --max-conversations 12 --per-conversation 5
.fi
.SS MESSAGE
Inspect, cite, stage, and send messages.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi message get T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi message send --to '#eng' --text 'Ready'
.fi
.SS MESSAGE GET
Fetch a root message or thread reply by stable reference.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi message get T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi message get T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --full
.fi
.SS MESSAGE CITE
Build citations for up to 50 message references.
.PP
Defaults: message text previews are capped at 600 Unicode characters
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi message cite T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi message cite T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712350.001201 --full
.fi
.SS MESSAGE SEND
Stage or directly apply one message send.
.PP
Defaults: staged only; unfurls disabled; message text is limited to 40,000 Unicode characters; broadcast mentions require --allow-broadcast; direct apply also requires a separate policy grant
.br
Incompatible combinations: Choose exactly one of --text or --text-file.
.nf
slack-axi message send --to '#eng' --text 'Ready'
.fi
.nf
slack-axi message send --to @alice --text-file ./note.txt
.fi
.nf
slack-axi message send --to C034DEF --text '<!here> deploy paused' --allow-broadcast
.fi
.SS MESSAGE REPLY
Stage or directly apply one thread reply.
.PP
Defaults: staged only; unfurls disabled; message text is limited to 40,000 Unicode characters; broadcast mentions require --allow-broadcast; direct apply also requires a separate policy grant
.br
Incompatible combinations: Choose exactly one of --text or --text-file; --to and --thread must name the same conversation.
.nf
slack-axi message reply --to C034DEF --thread T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --text 'Fixed'
.fi
.nf
slack-axi message reply --to C034DEF --thread T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --text-file -
.fi
.nf
slack-axi message reply --to C034DEF --thread T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --text '<!subteam^S012ABC> please review' --allow-broadcast
.fi
.SS REACTION
Inspect or safely mutate message reactions.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi reaction list T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi reaction add T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 eyes
.fi
.SS REACTION LIST
List normalized reactions on one message.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi reaction list T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi reaction list T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --output json
.fi
.SS REACTION ADD
Stage or apply adding one reaction.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi reaction add T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 eyes
.fi
.nf
slack-axi reaction add T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 white_check_mark --apply
.fi
.SS REACTION REMOVE
Stage or apply removing one reaction.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi reaction remove T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 eyes
.fi
.nf
slack-axi reaction remove T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 eyes --apply
.fi
.SS FILE
Inspect, download, or safely upload Slack files.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi file info F012ABC
.fi
.nf
slack-axi file get F012ABC --out ./report.pdf
.fi
.SS FILE INFO
Fetch normalized Slack file metadata.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi file info F012ABC
.fi
.nf
slack-axi file info F012ABC --fields id,name,size,mimetype
.fi
.SS FILE GET
Download one Slack file with streaming byte limits and atomic no-clobber semantics.
.PP
Defaults: existing destinations are preserved unless --overwrite is supplied
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi file get F012ABC --out ./report.pdf
.fi
.nf
slack-axi file get F012ABC --out ./report.pdf --max-bytes 2147483648 --overwrite
.fi
.SS FILE UPLOAD
Stage a bounded immutable snapshot for upload.
.PP
Defaults: staged only; --max-bytes 1073741824 (maximum 5368709120); comments are limited to 40,000 Unicode characters and cannot contain URL-like constructs; broadcast mentions require --allow-broadcast; direct apply also requires a separate policy grant
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi file upload ./report.pdf --to '#eng'
.fi
.nf
slack-axi file upload ./report.pdf --to C034DEF --thread T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi file upload ./report.pdf --to C034DEF --max-bytes 2147483648
.fi
.SS MARK-READ
Stage or apply a conversation read marker.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi mark-read '#eng'
.fi
.nf
slack-axi mark-read C034DEF --through T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
