List a bounded, schema-gated page of saved Slack Later items.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20; browser authentication required; continuation cursors carry the cumulative scanned count
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi later list
.fi
.nf
slack-axi later list --limit 50
.fi
.SS LATER COMPLETE
Stage or apply completion of one browser-only Later item.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi later complete T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200
.fi
.nf
slack-axi later complete T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --apply
.fi
.SS LATER SNOOZE
Stage or apply snoozing one browser-only Later item.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi later snooze T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --until 2026-08-21T09:00:00+02:00
.fi
.nf
slack-axi later snooze T012ABC/C034DEF/1786712345.001200 --until 2026-08-21T09:00:00+02:00 --apply
.fi
