Manage direct-apply policy.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi policy init
.fi
.nf
slack-axi policy validate ./policy.json
.fi
.nf
slack-axi policy apply ./policy.json
.fi
.SS POLICY INIT
Create the conservative global policy.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi policy init
.fi
.nf
slack-axi policy show
.fi
.SS POLICY SHOW
Show the effective global policy file.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi policy show
.fi
.nf
