.fi
.SS POLICY VALIDATE
Validate policy JSON without contacting Slack.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi policy validate ./policy.json
.fi
.nf
slack-axi policy validate
.fi
.SS POLICY APPLY
Atomically replace direct-apply policy through the dispatch authorization lock.
.PP
Defaults: replaces global policy; --project replaces the current-directory narrowing policy
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi policy apply ./policy.json
.fi
.nf
slack-axi policy apply ./.slack-axi-policy.json --project
.fi
.SS ACTION
Inspect and process signed staged mutations.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action list
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action show 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000
.fi
.SS ACTION LIST
List signed actions and cheap state totals.
.PP
Defaults: --limit 20
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action list
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action list --limit 50
.fi
.SS ACTION SHOW
Verify and show one signed action.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action show 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action show 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000 --output json
.fi
.SS ACTION APPLY
Apply one signed action exactly once.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action apply 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000 --approval <base64url-hmac>
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action apply 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000 --approval <base64url-hmac> --workspace work
.fi
.SS ACTION RECONCILE
Reconcile an unknown remote commit without replaying it.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action reconcile 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action reconcile 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000 --workspace work
.fi
.SS ACTION ABANDON
Acknowledge and close an unrecoverable unknown action.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action abandon 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000 --approval <base64url-hmac>
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action show 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000
.fi
.SS ACTION DELETE
Explicitly delete an unverifiable local action directory.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action delete 0198cafe-0000-7000-8000-000000000000 --force-unverified
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action list
.fi
.SS ACTION GC
Delete old terminal records and expired creation remnants.
.PP
Defaults: Global --output toon; no command-specific defaults.
.br
Incompatible combinations: None.
.nf
slack-axi action gc
.fi
.nf
slack-axi action gc --retention-days 7
.fi
.SH ACTION SAFETY
Staged actions expire after 15 minutes and are approved with --approval BASE64URL-HMAC. Unknown commits are never replayed. Use action reconcile when a remote identity exists or action abandon to acknowledge unresolved uncertainty.
.SH FILES
~/Library/Application Support/slack-axi/config.json
.br
~/Library/Application Support/slack-axi/policy.json
